   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Andrey Nikolaevich tells Eleonora how pleased he was to meet her talented nephew Denis. Realizing Katya lied to protect her engagement, Eleonora plays along as Denis's doting aunt—before learning that Alyokhin will not give them a single ruble.",
